  "support_clearance_math": "The linear support ramp starts one maximum OLED face X-span before the analytic quadratic sag begins. Thus any OLED face with nonzero sag lies fully beyond the ramp start; for each vertex its quadratic drop is no greater than the support ramp. The affine ramp therefore stays below every interpolated OLED triangle. The flat centre is retained. Glass top is additionally 0.035 mm below OLED; aluminum top is 0.060 mm below. The broader underlay ramp is concealed by OLED; at the visible outer glass edge, support and OLED edge both drop exactly 1 mm.",
